.TH VIBEOS-MESSAGING 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-messaging \- messaging app for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-messaging
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Messaging app rebuilt in GTK 4 for SMS: conversations, the composer, forwarding, archiving and blocked contacts. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Messaging and opens sms: and smsto: links.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-messaging-sms(1)
